    "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:16:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-05T08:16:58Z",
    "body": "> I will try and build a table of _all_ HTML elements based and go through those instead.\n\nThe list in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#elements-3 is somewhat complete.\n\nQuestion for the group, should I include stuff that is [non-conforming](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#non-conforming-features) but still implemented in browsers, like e.g. `<plaintext>`?\nI could write text that we don't allow `<plaintext>` in the default config because it basically breaks the page, but I could also wirte a footnote that we don't allow any of the non-conforming elements?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
