    "updated_at": "2025-11-05T09:12:54Z",
    "body": "It might also be worth thinking about how we want to integrate this into HTML eventually. Should this be as a separate table/list or should it be part of each element definition? The latter makes it less likely we'll forget about it for new elements.",
