    "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:52:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-05T09:52:17Z",
    "body": "I may have mentioned this in the past that I would really value a notion of whether an element / attribute is \"safe for untrusted content\" (= allowed by default) that we use throughout the HTML standard. Curious to hear what @zcorpan thinks of this.",
